Known persistent transitions without a hook:

- rebuild install: Directory-entry persistence of the recovery marker and the backup/install renames: rebuild-install hooks fault the operations, but the model does not lose unsynced directory entries. (#3011)
- shared reader leases: Reader lease-file publication, renewal and expiry have observer stages only (CoordinationStage); no registered fault point interrupts them.

